.modal-header
    h3.m-0 {{machine.name}}
    .text-muted.ms-auto {{machine.ip}} · {{machine.os}}

.modal-body
    .mb-3
        label(translate) Username
        input.form-control(
            type='text',
            autofocus,
            [(ngModel)]='settings.user',
            [placeholder]='defaultUser',
        )

    .mb-3
        label(translate) Authentication
        .btn-group.w-100(role='group')
            input.btn-check(
                type='radio',
                name='tailscaleAuth',
                id='tailscaleAuthTailscale',
                [(ngModel)]='settings.auth',
                [value]='"tailscale"'
            )
            label.btn.btn-secondary(for='tailscaleAuthTailscale', translate) Tailscale SSH (no key)
            input.btn-check(
                type='radio',
                name='tailscaleAuth',
                id='tailscaleAuthKey',
                [(ngModel)]='settings.auth',
                [value]='"key"'
            )
            label.btn.btn-secondary(for='tailscaleAuthKey', translate) SSH key
        .form-text(*ngIf='settings.auth === "tailscale" && !machine.tailscaleSSH', translate) Tailscale SSH does not seem to be enabled on this machine. Run "tailscale up --ssh" on it, or use an SSH key.
        .form-text(*ngIf='settings.auth === "key"', translate) The SSH agent and the keys in ~/.ssh are tried automatically. Pick a file only to use a specific key.

    .mb-3(*ngIf='settings.auth === "key"')
        label(translate) Private key
        .input-group
            input.form-control(type='text', readonly, [value]='settings.privateKey || ""', [placeholder]='"Automatic"|translate')
            button.btn.btn-secondary((click)='pickPrivateKey()', translate) Choose…
            button.btn.btn-secondary(*ngIf='settings.privateKey', (click)='settings.privateKey = undefined')
                i.fas.fa-trash

    .mb-3
        label(translate) Claude Code working folder
        input.form-control(
            type='text',
            [(ngModel)]='settings.workdir',
            placeholder='~/projects/example',
            [class.is-invalid]='!workdirValid',
        )
        .form-text(translate) The folder Claude Code starts in. Leave empty for the home folder.
        .invalid-feedback(translate) Quotes, backslashes and $ cannot be used.

.modal-footer
    button.btn.btn-secondary((click)='cancel()', translate) Cancel
    button.btn.btn-primary((click)='ok()', [disabled]='!workdirValid', translate) Save
